+-----------------------------------------------------------------------
| Running ${PKGSTEM} on OpenBSD
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------

Crush executes shell commands and configured MCP servers with the invoking
user's permissions. This port does not provide an OpenBSD command sandbox.

The local server uses a per-user Unix socket with owner-only permissions.
The optional TCP API has no authentication. Its Host, Origin and browser
request checks do not authenticate clients; do not expose it to untrusted
users or networks.
